        <item>
            <title>1.0.9</title>
            <pubDate>Wed, 09 Sep 2026 14:38:59 -0400</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>1.0.9</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.0.9</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[### Licences

Cubby can now take a licence key. Settings → Licence, paste it, done — it is
checked once and then kept on your Mac, so it keeps working with no connection
and no account. One licence covers three Macs.

**Cubby is still free.** If you are already using it, it stays free on this Mac
permanently — there is nothing to buy and nothing to enter.

### Help

Settings → Help has an Email us button. It reaches a person, and it fills in
your version and macOS build so you do not have to go looking for them.

### Fixes

- Removing a licence now frees that Mac's slot properly, so moving to a new
  machine no longer uses up a spare.
]]></description>
